{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124212","id":4754470494,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG2N2Xg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124212","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124212.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124212.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124212","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124212/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124212/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124212/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5a309efb18dc83ff75daca26bc2728ac8f71aa42","number":124212,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Use bulk-copy `memcpy` call in `_copy_region`","user":{"login":"ALiwoto","id":70187458,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTg3NDU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70187458?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto","html_url":"https://github.com/ALiwoto","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe `_copy_region` was using a loop to copy data byte-by-byte, and that was causing significant lag in my game (I had a MoviePlayer, pausing it worked but hiding it didn't), replacing that byte-by-byte copy with a bulk copy (`memcpy` call) solved the issue.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nNote: since this loop is very simple, there is a high chance that it gets optimized away by compilers. (but optimized compile operations take time so I compile the engine with compiler optimization disabled (`optimize=none`). But the change is simple enough that I thought it's worth a pr.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists